# DRC-XOV-1: exact_overlap m1c; sibling cells with m1c [0,4]^2 and [2,6]x[0,4]; the same cells abutting at x=24; an m1c cell over the m1 of a third cell.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load a
box 0 0 4 4
paint m1c
load b
box 0 0 4 4
paint m1c
load c
box 0 0 10 10
paint m1
load top
box 0 0 0 0
getcell a
box 2 0 2 0
getcell b
box 20 0 20 0
getcell a
box 24 0 24 0
getcell b
box 40 0 40 0
getcell c
box 42 2 42 2
getcell a
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
writeall force
